cmd-tr-desc = Translates a sentence and says the result out loud. To translate everything you say, use a translator.
cmd-tr-help = Usage: tr <language> <message>. Languages: pt, en, ru. The source language is detected from the text, falling back to the station language.
cmd-tr-idioma-invalido = Unknown language "{ $idioma }". Accepted: { $aceitos }.
cmd-tr-desligado = Translation is turned off on this server.
cmd-tr-mesmo-idioma = The message already looks like it is in { $idioma }.
cmd-tr-falhou = Could not translate: { $motivo }
